              "name": "LearningToCook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was dry and the lemon flavor did not mesh well with the sugar. There was also way too much seasoning. To be fair, I doubled the pasta and doubled the seasoning, so it was a lot. I ended up washing it off in a colander because we couldn't eat it.",
